[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         '''
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         f(n) = ways to fill a full board of size n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         p(n) = ways to fill a full board of size n + 1 square (up or down) aka. partial
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         i) f(n) = f(n-1) + f(n-2) + 2*p(n-2)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         ii) p(n) = f(n-1) + p(n-1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         By substituting ii) in i)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         iii) f(n) = f(n-1) + f(n-2) + 2*f(n-3) + 2*p(n-3)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         By substituting i) in iii)
