[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         Simplifying iv in terms of f()
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         v) f(n) = 2*f(n-1) + f(n-3)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         Recurrence Equation from above:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         f(n) = 0 when n=0;
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m              = 1 when n=1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m              = 2 when n=2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m              = 5 when n=3
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m              = 2*f(n-1) + f(n-3) when n>3
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         '''
