[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     对于一个给定的字符序列S，请你把其循环左移K位后的序列输出。
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     例如，字符序列S=”abcXYZdef”,要求输出循环左移3位后的结果，即“XYZdefabc”。
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     是不是很简单？OK，搞定它！
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     -----------------------------------------
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     Think:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     1、最开始的想法是，如果移动是位数没有超过字符串的位数，那么可以直接切割文本，然后拼接到最后。
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         如果左移的位数超过了字符串的位数，那么 n % length 就是需要左移的位数。
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     2、假设左移动3位置，不采用辅助空间，a = "abc",b = "XYZdef"反转为；"cba""fedZYX"
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         然后再进行反转
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     -----------------------------------------
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     Idea:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     1、直接计算左移的位数 n % length，然后切割字符串
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     2、通过3次反转获得需要的字符串,假设左移动3位置，不采用辅助空间，a = "abc",
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         b = "XYZdef"反转为；"cba""fedZYX"，然后把cbafedZYX反转成：
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         XYZdefabc
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     -----------------------------------------
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     Code[1]:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     def LeftRotateString(self, s, n):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         if (s is ""):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m             return ""
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         leftmove = n % len(s)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         newtail = s[:leftmove]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         newhead = s[leftmove:]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         return newhead + newtail
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     -----------------------
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     运行时间：33ms
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     占用内存：5624k
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     量级:O(n)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     空间：需要额外的空间n
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     优点：容易想到和实现
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     缺点：当字符串非常大时，需要额外的空间
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     -----------------------------------------
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     Code[2]:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     def LeftRotateString(self, s, n):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         if (s is ""):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m             return ""
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         slength = len(s)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         n = n % slength
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         s = list(s) # 为了让字符串可以反转，转为list
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         s = self.reversal(s,0,n-1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         s = self.reversal(s,n,slength-1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         s = self.reversal(s,0,slength-1)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         return "".join([i for i in s])
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m     def reversal(self,s,start,end):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         while start < end:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m             s[start],s[end] = s[end],s[start]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m             start += 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m             end -= 1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m         return s
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2742912)[0m 
